{"3665970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drop Adventure - مغامرة قطرة", "steam_appid": 3665970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the world of Drops, where peace, trees, and tranquility reign, an army of barrels turns this peaceful world into a nightmare. This is the story of our hero, the brave Drops, who is summoned for help by the village elder Drops, only to discover that his mission is fraught with danger. Drops must save this world. What a mission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >في عالم &quot;القطرات&quot;، حيث يسود السلام والأشجار والسكينة، يحوّل جيش من البراميل هذا العالم الهادئ إلى كابوس. هذه قصة بطلنا، &quot;دروبس&quot; الشجاع، الذي يستدعيه خبير قرية &quot;دروبس&quot; للمساعدة، ليكتشف أن مهمته محفوفة بالمخاطر. لا بد أن ينقذ &quot;دروبس&quot; هذا العالم. يا لها من مهمة!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/1c1de66840daa221916adaa66478d1a3.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For the brave Drops, this journey will not only involve saving the world of Drops, but will also involve developing his own water molecules and discovering the maximum capabilities he can achieve on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >بالنسبة لـ&quot;دروبس&quot; الشجاع، لن تقتصر هذه الرحلة على إنقاذ عالم القطرات فحسب، بل ستشمل أيضًا تطوير جزيئات الماء الخاصة به واكتشاف الحد الأقصى من القدرات التي يمكنه تحقيقها في هذه الرحلة.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/69f45fec29ef1eb5b21d939df5c8a2ac.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will have options to evolve the water molecules of your brave Drops, between each stage, the enemy will evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >سيكون لديك خيارات لتطوير جزيئات الماء الخاصة بـ &quot;دروبس&quot; الشجاع ، بين كل مرحلة، سوف يتطور العدو.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/96f8e2290918f942259e8187eba33fa6.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this adventure you will face some puzzles that you have to solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >في هذه المغامرة سوف تواجه بعض الألغاز التي عليك حلها.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.webm?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/7235d99fab38fcdb9536a454fcbca94f.mp4?t=1746644779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mission will inevitably be risky.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ستكون المهمة محفوفة بالمخاطر حتما.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665970/extras/da03f2d52c3a99dca6613b0eaf2dd934.poster.avif?t=1746644779\" width=800 height=450 ><source src